---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Tags
permalink: /tags/
---
<h1>Tags</h1>
<p>Every tag used in the recipes, with the number of recipes for each.</p>
<ul class="tag-cloud">
  {% for t in collections.tagList %}
  <li><a class="tag-link" href="/tags/{{ t.slug }}/"><span class="tag">{{ t.name }}</span></a> <span class="count">{{ t.recipes.length }}</span></li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
